# This repository is PUBLIC and exists to deploy the Stepwise website on Render.
# Everything is ignored except the files the site needs, so the app's source code, signing and
# release scripts, and docs cannot be committed by accident (`git add .` is safe here).
#
# To keep the whole project in git instead, make the GitHub repo PRIVATE first, then delete
# everything below the line marked WHITELIST and re-add the old ignores (dist/, xcuserdata/, ...).

# --- WHITELIST ---
/*
!/.gitignore
!/render.yaml
!/website/
!/scripts/
/scripts/*
!/scripts/check_site.py
!/.github/
.DS_Store
